    LLM: 'Game: Kleurenwiezen. Logic: Belgian bidding trick-taking game with complex contract hierarchy.',
    Player: "Kleurenwiezen (Belgian Colour Whist) is the national card game of Belgium. Players bid to decide the contract for the round, from winning tricks with a partner to winning zero tricks solo ('MisÃ¨re').",
